{"v":3,"catch":"BEE系列第二彈！為打磚塊遊戲注入全新魅力！","desc":"《BOMB BEE》是NAMCO LIMITED（現Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1979年推出的打磚塊遊戲。\n這款《GEE BEE》續作的最大特色，正如其名所示——炸彈！\n在遊戲場中尋找隱藏炸彈，引發連鎖爆炸，挑戰高分紀錄！本作與前作相同支援滑鼠操作，透過簡易控制盡情體驗BOMB BEE的魅力吧！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-11-20","genres":["街機","動作","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/923230fa9a08719ca8d7049e81073a613dda8ce71a67e9d8bd7450cbd9f88072.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bbe4ab89073accc590ab7f549e9feafca01b7183a8278f6dada2a22f0608d324.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9758c8586674a591bf8212c445aed0582c9bc14040279dc6bdf1f8729464ae1f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8cdaa92e014d892f4a00a47bd564e2c26769248ff082f792a84211195ef2c59b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b9e3d8edcabf65d012c436b73ba27ea694ff60ad1ef93050ece0bb20b9c7cf4a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bd4eb2f863150c8214875e7f3858538916d45c22a3360465771a8f22e805afce.jpg"],"titleId":"0100075025240000","dlc":[]}